messages.content:
Since the machine needs only one nexiom, four pairs are still possible. Each contains semabil or fozatuk, and also koramen or nalezul:
- {semabil, koramen}
- {semabil, nalezul}
- {koramen, fozatuk}
- {nalezul, fozatuk}

One test has only two outcomes, so I can't separate all four for certain. Whatever I test, I'll be left guessing between two pairs. Testing koramen alone splits them evenly:
- **Lights up:** {semabil, koramen} or {koramen, fozatuk}.
- **Stays dark:** {semabil, nalezul} or {nalezul, fozatuk}.

TEST: koramen
